i111-wei-huo"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p004","quote":"元光五年，青為車騎將軍，擊匈奴，出上谷；太僕公孫賀為輕車將軍，出雲中；大中大夫公孫敖為騎將軍，出代郡；衛尉李廣為驍騎將軍，出雁門：軍各萬騎。青至蘢城，斬首虜數百。騎將軍敖亡七千騎；衛尉李廣為虜所得，得脫歸：皆當斬，贖為庶人。賀亦無功。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-111","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo"}],"rationale":"第1段子夫男弟步廣皆冒衛氏的廣是親屬敘事；第4段衛尉李廣的廣是四將出征與被俘逃歸敘事，同字不合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p001","text":"大將軍衛青者，平陽人也。其父鄭季，為吏，給事平陽侯家，與侯妾衛媼通，生青。青同母兄衛長子，而姊衛子夫自平陽公主家得幸天子，故冒姓為衛氏。字仲卿。長子更字長君。長君母號為衛媼。媼長女衛孺，次女少兒，次女即子夫。後子夫男弟步、廣皆冒衛氏。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"衛青","kind":"person","person_id":"5dd_l1c_6g8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"鄭季","kind":"person","person_id":"8s7_pof_xsh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"平陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"pvv_knd_ixe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"侯","kind":"person","person_id":"pvv_knd_ixe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"衛媼","kind":"person","person_id":"qvp_drq_pf5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"5dd_l1c_6g8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"5dd_l1c_6g8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"衛長子","kind":"person","person_id":"5nt_1fk_g2o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m001-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"衛子夫","kind":"person","person_id":"l5c_h8i_d5q","status":